      "content": "Please hear this: you did not fail, and you are not responsible for his life or death. The loss of a life you loved creates an immense void, and it is natural to feel lost when your purpose was intertwined with another person. If you are feeling like you have reached the end of your rope, please connect with someone immediately by calling or texting 988 to talk to a crisis counselor. You do not have to carry this darkness alone.",
